# Python
# NOTE: the packaging directories below are anchored with a leading slash so
# they match only at the repository root. An unanchored `lib/` also matches
# `frontend/src/lib/`, which silently excluded the frontend's API layer from
# both git and the Cloud Build upload — the commit looked clean and the build
# failed with "Cannot find module '../../lib/api'".
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.venv/
venv/
/env/
/ENV/
/build/
/develop-eggs/
/dist/
/downloads/
/eggs/
/.eggs/
/lib/
/lib64/
/parts/
/sdist/
/var/
/wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
frontend/dist/

# Environment variables & secrets
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key

# IDE & OS
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Strategy research, competitive analysis and submission planning. Working
# material, not part of the product -- and some of it names and critiques real
# competitor projects. The architecture diagram lives in assets/ instead.
docs/

# Recording script for the demo video. Personal working material like docs/
# above: shot list, stage directions and notes to self, none of it part of the
# product. Deliberately untracked rather than deleted, because the file is in
# use while the video is being recorded.
video-narration.md
